WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.500
Do not trust one draft. Watch them argue.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.450
Two candidates diverge at high temperature. Different bets, same goal.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:14.800
Each refines at low temperature: tight, careful, testable.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.550
Then the gate: syntax, tests, secrets. Deterministic. No charm offensives.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:28.950
One branch dies here.  Its failure is kept as evidence, never deleted.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:35.300
The survivor faces critique: scored against its own best objection.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.100
Synthesis merges what survived into one champion.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:45.375
The champion ships with its corpses attached: every loss kept.

00:00:46.575 --> 00:00:51.950
Honesty: live-model quality is unqualified, and the Trace loop is still vision.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:58.150
Do not trust one draft.  Run the dialectic.
